				"url": "https://fosstodon.org/@hasanhaja",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/698/107/255/349/105/original/a8b5515bdc4a7805.png"
			},
			"date": "2023-04-30T13:51:02.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> what is the abstraction that web components are trying to solve? Is it to organize markup, behavior and styles for developers? If so, what benefits does it offer over a UI framework like SolidJS? Lastly, what is its overhead and how does it scale compared to something like SolidJS?</p>",
