			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://piaille.fr/@tbroyer\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>tbroyer</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fosstodon.org/@enhance_dev\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>enhance_dev</span></a></span> I don’t want to go too far into tooling around web components in this talk but it’s probably most accurate to say that WebC (and others!) use conventions for server side rendering set forth by web components standards. Some overlap with how I think of SCSS -&gt; CSS</p>",
